            {
              "id": "/page/166/Caption/3",
              "block_type": "Caption",
              "html": "<p></p><div><p><b>Figure 4.5</b> Geometric illustration of QP. The feasible set <math>\\mathcal{P}</math>, which is a polyhedron, is shown shaded. The contour lines of the objective function, which is convex quadratic, are shown as dashed curves. The point <math>x^*</math> is optimal.</p></div>",
              "polygon": [
                [
                  130.356,
                  296.208
                ],
                [
                  436.968,
                  296.208
                ],
                [
                  436.968,
                  328.67999999999995
                ],
                [
                  130.356,
                  328.67999999999995
                ]
              ],
              "bbox": [
